ou got it support the  united states postal service so when you  go to nurochstersmerch.com you're gonna  see all kinds of solid neurostars merch  to hide your shame with it's all high  quality nice looking stuff i would  actually wear in real life that has been  my main requirement for this whole merch  thing  yay no more of those stupid shady third  party sellers that mail me  weirdly wrapped scratchy awkwardly  fitting shirts i'm throwing it all out  i've already started  from the waist down look i'm a nerd  philip is a nerd and we know exactly  what nerds are looking for so  finally we're gonna hug you with some of  our nerd love  you probably should have waited to say  that you were bottomless till after the  hug  thing come and get your head speaking of  pouring yourself out here is the best  part of finally doing merch  the more that we can transition to  selling our merch rather than selling  other people's products the fewer  outside sponsors will have to interrupt  our videos with now for  the time being those are the only reason  we still have our jobs but  we would love for new rockstars merch to  be our own in-house small business to  keep us afloat so that  we can become finally more self-reliant  it's exactly like when eric sold  lemonade to emancipate himself from his  birth parents  uh-huh i've been on my own since i was  this many  oh also we almost forgot the thing i am  most excited about this whole  merch thing we are launching a line of  collectible shirts  that are about whatever our latest  obsession of the moment is  it is called latest obsession and guys  when we say collectible remember we're  nerds we know what that means  that means limited run numbered items or  living beings that say their own names  these shirts will only be available for  the length of time that we are making  current breakdowns about that given  topic  and when we run out of our initial  orders we won't be ordering any more it  goes back into the dungeon  with me so